  "description": "Money is essential for survival.\n\nIn the pitch-black of night, a burglar broke into a house to steal cash—only to encounter a man of unimaginable danger.\n\nKnocked unconscious in a single blow, the intruder wakes up in... an unfamiliar warehouse?\n\nMasumi, the homeowner, offers the desperate burglar a choice: become his \"dog\" to atone for the attempted robbery.\n\nTrapped in confinement with no escape, what will become of the dangerous relationship between these two, bound by madness and obsession?\n\n-----\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/kaiinu) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \nKorean: [DLsite](https://www.dlsite.com/bl/work/=/product_id/RJ01507319.html), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/kaiinu_), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/pay_dog)  \nOthers: English (Sep 12), [S.Chinese](https://www.dlsite.com/bl/work/=/product_id/RJ01507407.html), [T.Chinese](https://www.dlsite.com/bl/work/=/product_id/RJ01507409.html)",
